          {
            "title": "Example: Comma",
            "id": 116112,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli il segno corretto per separare i due parametri.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addPrefix\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prefix, word\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prefix + word;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" newWord = addPrefix(\" /><text value=\"&quot;re&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;do&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(newWord);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"redo\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Order",
            "id": 116117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come passiamo i valori a una funzione con più parametri?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I valori e i parametri devono essere nello stesso ordine</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Possiamo passare i valori in qualsiasi ordine</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I valori e i parametri devono essere in ordine inverso</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I valori e i parametri devono essere nello stesso ordine.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione viene dichiarata con <code>first</code>, poi <code>second</code> e infine <code>third</code>. Come devono essere passati i valori quando la chiami?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nello stesso ordine dei parametri</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">In qualsiasi ordine, perché i nomi dei parametri corrispondono</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">In ordine inverso</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Abbinando ogni valore al nome di un parametro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nello stesso ordine dei parametri.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Order",
            "id": 116113,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli i valori corretti in modo che <code>\"Helene\"</code> venga visualizzato per secondo e <code>\"Joe\"</code> per ultimo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showWinners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3rd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showWinners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helene&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"163\" endIndex=\"171\" /><option startIndex=\"171\" endIndex=\"172\" /><option startIndex=\"173\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1st: Elaine\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Helen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3rd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Helene\"</code>, seguito da <code>,</code> e infine <code>\"Joe\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa i parametri affinché la chiamata visualizzi <code>Helene</code> per seconda e <code>Joe</code> per terzo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showWinners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3rd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showWinners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helene&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"winner\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Helene&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1st: Elaine\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Helene\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3rd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>first</code>, seguito da <code>second</code> e infine <code>third</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple parameters",
            "id": 116119,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sumUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = sumUp(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"123\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">123</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">100203</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">100+20+3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere 123.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La chiamata passa tre numeri a <code>sumUp</code>. Quale valore viene restituito e poi visualizzato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sumUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = sumUp(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"123\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>123</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100203</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>100 + 20 + 3</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>123</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 116111,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli il secondo parametro corretto per questa funzione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"currentYear, yearOfBirth\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentYear - yearOfBirth;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = getAge(\" /><text value=\"2022\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1998\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1998\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"24\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>yearOfBirth</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione sottrae un anno di nascita dall'anno corrente. Assegna un nome al secondo parametro in modo che la chiamata produca l'età <code>24</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"currentYear, yearOfBirth\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentYear - yearOfBirth;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = getAge(\" /><text value=\"2022\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1998\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"currentYear\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"24\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>yearOfBirth</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Naming Functions",
            "id": 116417,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale delle seguenti affermazioni è vera quando si tratta di dare un nome a una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I nomi delle funzioni dovrebbero essere chiari e descrivere ciò che fa la funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Possiamo dare a una funzione il nome che vogliamo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">È meglio avere un nome lungo e complesso per una funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I nomi delle funzioni dovrebbero essere chiari e descrivere ciò che fa la funzione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vedi una funzione chiamata <code>displayNumberOfNames</code>. Perché è un nome migliore di uno vago come <code>run</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Descrive chiaramente cosa fa la funzione.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Indica quanti nomi sono attualmente presenti nell'array.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La sua lunghezza lo rende più chiaro, indipendentemente dal significato delle parole.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Descrive chiaramente cosa fa la funzione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "array.length",
            "id": 116469,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale valore visualizza il codice seguente?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"names\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(names.length);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" students = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Laurel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yanni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames(students);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Immagina di aggiungere <code>\"Ada\"</code> a <code>students</code> prima della chiamata di funzione. Cosa visualizzerebbe?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"names\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(names.length);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" students = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Laurel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Yanni&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayNumberOfNames(students);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Processed Values",
            "id": 116473,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza il codice seguente?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" array = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Patricia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Isaac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"processValues\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"arr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot; and &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + arr[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] +\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot; are the last two student names in reverse order.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"processValues(array);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Jon and Leia are the last two student names in reverse order</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Patricia and Isaac are the last two student names in reverse order</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione legge <code>arr[3]</code> prima di <code>arr[2]</code>. Quali due nomi compaiono nel messaggio?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" array = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Patricia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Isaac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"processValues\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"arr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot; and &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + arr[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] +\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot; are the last two student names in reverse order.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"processValues(array);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Isaac and Patricia are the last two student names in reverse order.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Isaac</code> e <code>Patricia</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Jon</code> e <code>Leia</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Patricia</code> e <code>Isaac</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>Isaac</code> e <code>Jon</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Isaac</code> e <code>Patricia</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Verb/Prefix",
            "id": 116474,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli il nome di funzione più appropriato per la funzione seguente, che visualizza il nome utente del cliente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"info\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;ID: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Megan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2837434\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo(user);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display(user)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Name: Megan, ID: 2837434\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>displayUserInfo(info)</code>, seguito da <code>displayUserInfo(user)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la definizione e la chiamata affinché la funzione riceva l'array <code>user</code> dichiarato e ne visualizzi nome e ID.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"info\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;ID: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + info[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Megan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2837434\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayUserInfo(user);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayUserInfo()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayUserInfo(&quot;user&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayUserInfo(info[0])\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Name: Megan, ID: 2837434\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>displayUserInfo(info)</code>, seguito da <code>displayUserInfo(user)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing Correct Input",
            "id": 116475,
